<title>USA: New Century to join midcap index, S&amp;P says.</title>
<headline>New Century to join midcap index, S&amp;P says.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Friday it will  add New Century Energies Inc and Martin Marietta Materials Inc to  the S&amp;P MidCap 400 Index after the close of trading on August 4.</p>
<p>New Century Energies was formed by the merger of Public Service Co  of Colorado and Southwestern Public Service Co, both of which were  in the S&amp;P MidCap 400 Index, Standard &amp; Poor's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
